  "details": "Using the desktop arm movement is a little fatiguing on my index finger, and multiple friends of mine have expressed concerns due to the middle mouse button being the first thing to break on their mice. \n\nBeing able to switch the key required for arm movement would be ideal, but alternatively, changing it to a toggle would help reduce strain. For example, holding it to select your hand and then releasing it would allow you to puppet your arm of choice without having to hold the button in, and then clicking on the button again would release your arms.",
